# POS's own system integration (src/pos-integration): data, and the
# pos-stage script. Its PAM stack uses pam's modules, systemd's pam_systemd
# and util-linux's login; pos-stage bash, coreutils, systemd and glibc's
# ldconfig; pos-kernel kernel-install (systemd) and its dracut plugin,
# cpio, xz, zstd, gzip, gawk, sed, grep and util-linux's flock (curl, which it
# downloads with, is in the network stage).
requires pam systemd util-linux bash coreutils glibc dracut cpio xz zstd gzip gawk sed grep
